  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach injury recorded on the
    hero this wave gives Prizefighter companions 1% attack speed, up to 15%. Multiple
    copies do not multiply this speed bonus.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Bullet
    size: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging
    three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA keeper
    of cold stores who sheltered passengers during a heat wave. One store stayed
    cold after its key vanished. They seek every missing key, including those opening
    doors they were ordered to leave alone.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic
    personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: frost, gauntlet,
    shoe. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
